@startuml
title Internet carrier (US-9) — coordinates via Viber share, no server, E2E by app keys
autonumber
participant "SessionManager\n(A)" as SM
participant "ShareTransport\n(A)" as ST
participant "Android\nshare sheet" as SHEET
participant "Viber" as V
participant "member B\n(phone)" as B
participant "ShareInbox\n(B) + SessionManager" as IN

== Outgoing (member A, internet present) ==
SM -> ST : send(wireFrame)  // AEAD frame, ~150 B
ST -> ST : envelope = "fmiw1:" + base64url(wireFrame)
ST -> SHEET : startActivity(ACTION_SEND, type=text,\npackage=com.viber.voip, EXTRA_TEXT=envelope)
ST -> SM : SendResult.HandedToUser
SHEET -> V : user picks chat, taps send
V -> B : Viber message (carrier sees opaque text)

== Incoming (member B) ==
B -> V : long-press message -> Share
V -> SHEET : ACTION_SEND text/plain
SHEET -> IN : user picks "find me in wood"
IN -> IN : parseEnvelope -> wireFrame\n(Base64url decode)
IN -> SM : acceptExternalWire(wire, source=INTERNET)
SM -> SM : netId filter -> replay window ->\nAEAD open (trafficKey) -> CBOR decode
SM -> SM : PeerTracker.onBeacon
note over SM : invalid/tampered envelope -> drop,\nauth-fail counter++ (never processed)

== Optional auto mode (FR-9.2) ==
SM -> ST : every new fix
ST -> ST : copy envelope to clipboard\n(user pastes into any chat)
@enduml
